{"id":"vod_sn_37475","vodId":"37475","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"S·A特优生","name_cn":"S·A特优生","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cfd8d36f84dfe0dbed7100be42d9068b.jpg"},"summary":"被热爱职业摔跤的父亲从小悉心培养长大的华园光（后藤邑子 配音）是个摔跤高手，她从没碰到过对手，直到泷岛彗（福山润 配音）的出现。为了打败彗，光说服父亲考进了白选馆学园高校，并进入了S•A班。所谓S•A班就是special A班，尖子班中的尖子班，只有全年级前七名的精英学生才能进入S•A班。但是光在这里依然打不败全年级第一的彗，还被彗戏谑地称作永远的第二名。除了彗和光，S•A班里还有第三名、第四名的天才音乐家的孩子山本纯（代永翼 配音）和山本芽（高垣彩阳 配音）双胞胎兄妹；第五名的学院理事长的儿子狩野宙（下野紘 配音）；第六名的航空公司社长千金东堂明（生天目仁美 配音）；第七名的体育用品公司社长的儿子辻龙（堀江一真 配音）。光一次次挑战彗的故事还在继续……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:52:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zp8vHnHqJ11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mbrp1ydnK91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ykBa7ZeQfW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ckNp8baybB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Dabw4jFkUB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SYB690pzP31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H39DYcAquA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Htiudx9tPJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rn0tR2khMu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C20LZC0Wnk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UuMV0EeGXS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hwa69R9J9W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J4vXfUckwB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/0